@Fraud.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5083

### Test Health
GET {{Fraud.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

### Add Fraudulent Transaction (Amount > 1000)
POST {{Fraud.Api_HostAddress}}/graphql/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": "mutation { addTransaction(accountId: \"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001\", amount: 5000.50, merchant: \"Shady Electronics\") { id amount merchant } }"
}
